// added by tests/scenarios/run.py to td.scn, whose own trainsets were removed.
// a line of its own, away from the tracks of td.scn: 600 m level, then 5500 m up a gradient of 10 per mille,
// under an overhead wire. the train starts on the level with its head 10 m before the W4 of Gora and runs on the
// timetable {{timetable}} (leaves Gora at 10:35, no other stop) at the line limit of the timetable, up to the signal ul_sem
// at stop 5300 m up the gradient. the line goes on 200 m past it
